@page "/mods"

<SvxPageTitle Section="Mods" />

<div class="svx-page-header">
    <h2>Mods</h2>
    <p class="svx-page-description">Mod installation and management, per game definition.</p>
</div>

<div class="svx-empty-state">
    <h3>Mod management is not available yet</h3>
    <p>
        A game definition's own <code>mods.supported</code> flag says whether a game's mods COULD be
        managed, but this page does not read it for any definition yet — the mod installation pipeline
        itself ships in Milestone 9, for games whose definitions opt in.
    </p>
</div>
